        "TileImage": "$($repository 9d4e194d-67e5-48a6-819e-172556f40157).Image",
        "Description": "Manager of the Himmapan Hotel, Mrs. Mookjai, has been a loyal and honorable member of staff since the hotel was built.\r\rA few days ago the hotel was hosting a reception for a wedding, and one of the guests was in a drunken state and talked with Mrs. Mookjai for hours. Unfortunately that guest was Martha Herris, an ex spy for IAGO.\r\rLately, Mrs. Mookjai has become antsy, and we are worried that she was told criminalizing info and is about to leak it. \r\rWe can&apos;t afford risks now, eliminate her.",
